{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "foundation-platform.parcel_factories_by_pnu",
  "description": "A parcel's registered factories as 한국산업단지공단 전국등록공장현황 lists them (root ADR-0280 §4, ADR-0449): the newest edition's distinct factories whose 공장주소 resolved to the parcel, by 회사명, each in the provider's words (회사명, 단지명, 생산품), at most 50; factory_total counts them all.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
